@participant1 
> Also, there will be a new `layout-manager` interface, allowing you to save a session directly into your layouts folder 

Experiencing flaky persistence of sessions myself, I was going to suggest a feature: a `save-session` command which would allow users to force serialisation of current session. This would allow users to re-save frequently or before quitting session in order to ensure everything is saved.
